  "body": "### Label\n\npreneoplastic lesion\n\n### Synonyms\n\n_No response_\n\n### Synonym type\n\nNone\n\n### Definition\n\nA clonal proliferation of cells that have accumulated some, but not all, molecular alterations necessary for malignant transformation, representing an intermediate stage in carcinogenesis with increased risk of progression to invasive neoplasia. \n\nReferences: \n[40684183](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40684183/)\n[37775701](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37775701/)\n[40624726](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40624726/)\n[39754221](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39754221/)\n\n### Parent term\n\nMONDO:0700096 human disease\n\n### Children term(s)\n\n_No response_\n\n### ORCID Identifier\n\nhttps://orcid.org/0000-0002-2336-2552\n\n### Website URL\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional comments\n\n_No response_",
