      "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
      "body": "@corismall Thank you for this request.\n\nCurrently, we have these two terms in Mondo and it looks like the request term can be added as exact synonym to one of them.\n1. [MONDO:0021074 precancerous condition](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/mondo/classes/http%253A%252F%252Fpurl.obolibrary.org%252Fobo%252FMONDO_0021074) \n2. [ MONDO:0000611 pre-malignant neoplasm](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/mondo/classes/http%253A%252F%252Fpurl.obolibrary.org%252Fobo%252FMONDO_0000611)\n\nIf you do not agree with adding it as synonym, can you please let me know how the new term is different from these terms? \n\nThank you. \n",
