      "authorAssociation": "NONE",
      "body": "Hi @MeeSiing, sorry I was a bit preemptive with this decision, we actually would not prefer \"preneoplastic lesion\" to be added as an exact synonym. Sorry about that. This would mean that \"clonal hematopoiesis of indeterminate potential\" is a preneoplastic lesion which is not accurate.  ",
