        "login": "corismall"
      },
      "authorAssociation": "NONE",
      "body": "Hi @MeeSiing, we still need the new term, can you please make this a child term under \"precancerous condition\" rather than pre-malignant neoplasm? Pre-neoplastic lesion is not a type of neoplasm but rather before any neoplasm forms therefore pre-malignant neoplasm parent term would not work. Thank you!!",
